diff --git a/docs/labwc-config.5.scd b/docs/labwc-config.5.scd
index 6a16b89..97d4e1b 100644
--- a/docs/labwc-config.5.scd
+++ b/docs/labwc-config.5.scd
@@ -679,6 +679,40 @@ extending outward from the snapped edge.
 	Font weight (normal, thin, ultralight, light, semilight, book, medium,
 	semibold, bold, ultrabold, heavy, ultraheavy). Default is normal.
 
+## WINDOW EFFECTS
+
+Window effects apply to the content of regular Wayland and XWayland windows.
+Layer-shell surfaces, popups, menus, server-side decorations and captured
+window content are unaffected. Fullscreen windows are always opaque and have
+blur disabled to preserve direct scanout.
+
+*<windowEffects><enabled>* [yes|no]
+	Enable window opacity and blur. Default is no.
+
+*<windowEffects><activeOpacity>*
+	Opacity of the active window, between 0.0 and 1.0. Default is 1.0.
+
+*<windowEffects><inactiveOpacity>*
+	Opacity of inactive windows, between 0.0 and 1.0. Default is 1.0.
+
+*<windowEffects><blur><enabled>* [yes|no]
+	Blur the scene behind translucent windows. Default is no.
+
+*<windowEffects><blur><passes>*
+	Number of blur passes, between 0 and 10. Default is 3.
+
+*<windowEffects><blur><radius>*
+	Blur radius, between 0 and 10. Default is 5.
+
+*<windowEffects><blur><noise>*
+	Noise applied to the blur, between 0.0 and 1.0. Default is 0.02.
+
+*<windowEffects><blur><brightness>*++
+*<windowEffects><blur><contrast>*++
+*<windowEffects><blur><saturation>*
+	Blur color adjustments, each between 0.0 and 2.0. Defaults are 0.9,
+	0.9 and 1.1, respectively.
+
 ## MARGIN
 
 *<margin top="" bottom="" left="" right="" output="" />*
